-- title:
--   Original zero-jump Gaussian stopped reward has single centred martingale budget
-- statement:
--   When the original spectral negative Lévy source has ν=0, the exact original stopped discounted dividend reward is bounded pathwise by its starting value, one integrable centred Gaussian martingale and two nonpositive residuals. This isolates the physical Gaussian Itô–Meyer/discounted-dividend step; it retains actual X, D, σ, F and ruin/zero-clock atoms.
-- source:
